<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts CompUSA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts CompUSA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it started computer retailer CompUSA Inc with a market outperform rating.</p>
<p>The analyst, Matthew Fassler, was not available for comment and no other information was available.</p>
<p>Shares of CompUSA fell one to 21-7/8.</p>
</text>
